{"song_id": 7994787, "title": "Pop-Hip le mort-vivant", "language": "fr", "lyricists": [1019559], "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_0", "type": "intro", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "\"Mais, moi, j'aime bien aussi, Pop-Hip", "rhyme": "ip", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Et puis, il est mort mais il faudrait le ressusciter", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Pourquoi tu ressuscites pas Pop-Hip ?\"", "rhyme": "ip", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Pop-Hip", "rhyme": "ip", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "4", "text": "R\u00e9veille-toi", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}], "rhyme": "ABAAC", "rhyme_vowel": "ABAAC"}, {"section_id": "section_1", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Perdu dans mon enfer, j're\u00e7ois, du monast\u00e8re", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Des menaces, des SMS", "rhyme": "Om", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "2", "text": "J'visais le haut d'l'affiche, faire de la vari\u00e9toche", "rhyme": "OS", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "3", "text": "\u00c0 l'abri dans ma forteresse", "rhyme": "Es", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "4", "text": "J'ai pourri les albums 'vec mes sous qui t'assoment", "rhyme": "um", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Bubble gum", "rhyme": "Om", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "6", "text": "J'voulais pas faire mal", "rhyme": "al", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Mais j'ai vendu mon \u00e2me, c'est la gloire qui m'anime", "rhyme": "im", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "8", "text": "J'ai vis\u00e9 l'international", "rhyme": "al", "persona_id": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"